	)
	(text "U10 switches the 3.3 V screen supply (+3V3_UI) and reports overcurrent.\nCurrent-limit range: 234 to 303 mA (R43 100k 0.1%, S-25); panel + touch ~40 mA max. No bulk cap on +3V3_UI (C68 removed, S-12):\nno 190 mA inrush on +3V3_D at UI_EN; firmware UI power-cycle guard >= 50 ms.\nBacklight (LED-A) is fed from VSYS via F201/Q201, switched by UI_EN."
		(at 43.942 113.284 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2b21c219-badb-4be0-b8db-9e63cad08385")
	)
