  (text "J4: Newhaven NHD-2.4-240320AF-CSXP-CTP (ST7789Vi, 8080-II 8-bit on DB8-DB15, write-only)\nvia Omron XF2M-4015-1A; also fits NHD-2.8-...-FCTP. IM2:IM0 = 001 hard-tied (NHD Interface Selection p.5);\nRDX (J4.13) tied to +3V3_UI, PD4 (FMC_NOE) unused: firmware never reads the panel (S-11).\nJ8: FT5426 touch (I2C2, 0x38). FMC bank 1 NE1, D/C = A22; TE (J4.40) not connected (FEAT-6).\nDisplay and backlight are unpowered (UI_EN low) during acquisition."
    (at 144.78 55.88 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f243523c-ca6d-4f2b-bca3-e257ad8a6279")
  )
