		(property "Function" "Filters MARK_N_MCU (U8 pin 3) contact bounce and coupled noise with the PE4 internal pull-up (R49 removed, FEAT-5; 40k x 100 nF = 4 ms release); the 1k R47 limits its discharge on a press and forms a low-pass with it. Place near U8 pin 3 with a short ground return; firmware still debounces the button and arms it >= 30 ms after enabling the pull-up."
